  "contentrating": "Everyone",
  "description": "A quiet Japanese hot spring in the snow, seen from above. Steam drifts over the water - wipe it away with your mouse and watch it slowly return. Yuzu fruits, cherry blossom petals or maple leaves float and bob on real ripples, snowflakes melt into the pool, stone lanterns flicker, the tea is still warm. Click the water to make waves, move the mouse to draw ripples. Follows your clock from day to dusk to night and ripples to the beat of your music. Snow, rain or clear skies in the settings.",
